<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>StackedDeck.Project.Templates</PackageId>
    <PackageVersion>1.0.0</PackageVersion>
    <Title>Stacked Deck Project Templates</Title>
    <Authors>Vasil Kotsev</Authors>
    <Description>.NET Project templates, composed to give you advantage akin to a "stacked card deck".</Description>
    <PackageTags>dotnet;templates;aspnet-core;web-api;containers;docker;cli;spectre;console;production;csharp;editorconfig;stacked-deck</PackageTags>
    <PackageIcon>assets\sd-logo-7.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/SonnyRR/stacked-deck-templates/</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/SonnyRR/stacked-deck-templates</RepositoryUrl>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) Vasil Kotsev 2026</Copyright>
    <PackageLicenseFile>LICENSE</PackageLicenseFile>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageType>Template</PackageType>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <IncludeContentInPack>true</IncludeContentInPack>
    <IncludeBuildOutput>false</IncludeBuildOutput>
    <ContentTargetFolders>content</ContentTargetFolders>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);NU5128</NoWarn>
    <NoDefaultExcludes>true</NoDefaultExcludes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>✨ Features
- Introduce StackedDeck.CLI template project (ca3dbee)
- Introduce StackedDeck.Editorconfig item template (588dae1)
- Rework API versioning with per-version OpenAPI documents (2ac715a)
- Exclude InheritableApiVersionAttribute from MinimalAPI &amp; FastEndpoints (1b11486)
- Introduce xunit.runner.json (1b9a131)
- Randomize local development ports on project creation (2d94058)
- Override content path (cb47a9e)

🚀 Improvements
- Migrate build system from NUKE to FALLOUT (#134) (d170ae7)
- Migrate from VSTest to Microsoft Test Platform V2 (#202) (24c2048)
- Use container registry username instead of URL for image names (6e8a4a6)
- Change GHA workflow secret &amp; variable identifiers (6d71c73)
- Exclude unnecessary GH artifact when PP is None (c969f60)
- Simplify versioning setup for FastEndpoints (3784382)

🐛 Fixes
- Fix disposing method implementation to check disposing flag (72d5703)
- Downgrade FastEndpoints to latest stable version (818b614)

🔧 Chores
- Bump 3rd party NuGet dependencies (a19a071, 96136a8, b35e193, a22c2fe, bfd7876, bc35b49, 08f08c8, 91018da, 8ea6c22, and 15+ individual package bumps)
- Bump infrastructure image versions &amp; update configs (2cf604a, 8c7a2bd)
- Extend dependabot configuration (21b7c17)
- Remove deprecated telemetry opt-out environment variable (c96f216)
- Remove references to deprecated 'build.cmd' (2d411fe)

📝 Documentation
- Update READMEs (2c1b5a7)
- Replace AGENTS.md with symlink, add CLAUDE.md as canonical (815ffa8)

🤖 Development Tools
- Replace duplicated sd-logo-7.png copies with symlinks to assets/ canonical (cfa1008)</PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup>
    <LocalizeTemplates>false</LocalizeTemplates>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.TemplateEngine.Tasks" Version="7.0.120" PrivateAssets="all" IsImplicitlyDefined="true" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Content Include="content\**\*" Exclude="content\**\bin\**;content\**\obj\**;content\**\packages\**;content\**\pkg\**;**\.vs\**;content\**\.DS_Store;content\**\publish\**;content\**\.fallout\temp\**;content\**\.git\**;content\**\node_modules\**;content\**\.claude\package.json;content\**\.claude\.gitignore">
      <PackagePath>content</PackagePath>
    </Content>
    <Compile Remove="**\*" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
    <None Include="PKG_README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath=".\README.md" />
    <None Include="assets\sd-logo-7.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="assets\" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
